			<item>
				<title></title>
				<link>https://example.org/about-me/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://example.org/about-me/</guid>
				<description>&lt;section class=&#34;cta&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;p class=&#34;cta__subtitle&#34;&gt;  &lt;div class=&#34;tabs&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;tabs__nav&#34; role=&#34;tablist&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;tabs__label&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34; aria-selected=&#34;true&#34; data-tab=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;1em&#34; height=&#34;1em&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M12 4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4a4 4 0 0 1-4 4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4a4 4 0 0 1 4-4m0 2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2a2 2 0 0 0-2-2m0 7c2.67 0 8 1.33 8 4v3H4v-3c0-2.67 5.33-4 8-4m0 1.9c-2.97 0-6.1 1.46-6.1 2.1v1.1h12.2V17c0-.64-3.13-2.1-6.1-2.1&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span&gt;Who am I? &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;        &lt;button class=&#34;tabs__label&#34; type=&#34;button&#34; role=&#34;tab&#34; aria-selected=&#34;false&#34; data-tab=&#34;1&#34;&gt;&lt;svg xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; width=&#34;1em&#34; height=&#34;1em&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;path fill=&#34;currentColor&#34; d=&#34;M3 6v16h18v2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6zm13 3h5.5L16 3.5zM7 2h10l6 6v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2m0 2v14h14v-7h-7V4z&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;          &lt;span&gt;What &amp;amp; Why is this? &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/button&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;tabs__panel&#34; data-panel=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the name of the site would suggest, my name is Tim.&#xA;Passionate about the industry we call IT.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I have been involved in projects surrounding minecraft servers for a decade now.&#xA;This has included everything from server administration to server development.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I started moderating minecraft servers in 2013.&#xA;Hosted my own little servers throughout 2015–2019.&#xA;Became an administrator of an existing server in 2019.&#xA;Merged with that server in 2020, and we stayed online for about 5 years.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;During those years, we had even experimented with our own server plugin development.&#xA;This brought me to my introduction to the development side of this industry.&#xA;All this has made it, so I am very interested in the DevOps field with its focus on Linux, infrastructure and clean systems using code.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Now I am looking to spread my wings and take what I have learned to apply it to the broader IT industry.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;      &lt;div class=&#34;tabs__panel&#34; data-panel=&#34;1&#34; hidden&gt;&lt;p&gt;This website is a bit of a passion project.&#xA;I am looking to document what I know so far and maybe help others along the way.&#xA;So this is not a course or some training material.&#xA;What this is in reality is a collection of my knowledge and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Please don&amp;rsquo;t hold any of this as a source of truth or a source of wisdom.&#xA;Seeing, as I&amp;rsquo;m writing all of this by myself as a student, this project will have mistakes and errors.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I had started on a similar project for just myself in Obsidian for just one networking class I had.&#xA;This is an extension of that project and a way to share with people that which I have poured quite a lot of time into.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/section&gt;</description>
			</item>
